        "official_en_sha256": "1e94129480f52d614c797a760716158c1f51699b4946781564278ca2f4dd5538"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "やっぱり、ここか……。\r\nいつも鍵がかかってて、ずっと気になってたんだ。",
        "official_en": "I had a feeling it would be. I was always curious why it was kept locked.",
        "real_en": "I thought so... This door was always locked, and I could never stop wondering about it."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
