        "official_en_sha256": "7f5e828035ac03699dc07e21855287ae40c0cd3efa81c876086512334a1b6205"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "レインがこじ開けようとして\r\nレーゲンさんに怒られたこともあったな。",
        "official_en": "I know you were—Sir Raegan was not happy when he caught you trying to pry the door open.",
        "real_en": "Remember when you tried to force it open and Raegen-san scolded you?"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
